163→// AssertCheckpointInLastN asserts the given checkpoint ID appears in at
164→// least n commits on the checkpoint branch (e.g. initial + catchup).
165→// Uses --grep to find matching commits regardless of position, so extra
166→// commits from multi-commit agent turns don't cause false failures.
